tons;\nmissed calls stay at the top until answered with \"call back\" or \"OK\". Contacts read\nfavourites, then the people called lately, then everyone; a keypad with large keys; the\nlist of calls. Leave the call for another app and it stays in view: Android's own call\nnotification with one big \"hang up\", and a wide green band that brings the call back.\n\nRecording (off by default): a call is recorded and written out on the phone by\nwhisper.cpp, the model fetched once and shared with the other Reader's apps. Android only\ngives the sound of a call to an accessibility service, so one has to be switched on; the\nsettings say so. Tell the other person — in many countries the law requires it.\n\nSix languages. No account; the network is used only to fetch the model.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.freedomfighter.readersphone/en-US/icon_Y9JU0_KVDzdiHH9dd1fv2tnocRUWvD-uJ0x_Wm2PkLA=.png", "sha256": "63d254d3f2950f37621c7f5d7757efdad9e8711516bc3fae274c7f5a6d8f90b0", "size": 4196}}, "preferredSigner": "b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"}, "versions": {"e73ccb52e5f7969e7f49a757cabbebbde00057ff80465c34cc79385f0d8871b8": {"added": 1791281568000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersPhone-v1.1.0.apk", "sha256": "e73ccb52e5f7969e7f49a757cabbebbde00057ff80465c34cc79385f0d8871b8", "size": 30619325}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.1.0", "versionCode": 3, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.VIBRATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CALL_PHONE"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_CONTACTS"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_CALL_LOG"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "android.permission.SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW"}, {"